      "side": 1,
      "message": "Checking this return value will require some effort, and can easily be missed. Isn\u0027t it better to require a (sub)string that is checked against the panic message, to put some pressure on callers to not skip it? It could use %v formatting to deal with non-string panics, in case any of those occur.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 123,
